# experimentation only, never commit/ship. Lab code itself (lab/*.ts) is ours.
/lab/assets/
/lab/data/
# Storyboard captures of the reference site (third-party visuals) — reference only.
/new-storyboard/
# Superseded v6.15 Higgsfield hero-video assets (replaced by the WebGL scene in
